    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: Game design - Me\nProducer - Me\nPublisher - Me\nProgramming - Me\nArtist - Me\n3d artist - Me\n\nSpecial thanks to my mom, and to me for making this game\n\n<size=120%><b>Music</b></size>\nMiguel Angel\n\n<size=120%><b>Steam Art</b></size>\nGiovanni Fim\n\n<size=120%><b>Playtesters</b></size>\nContact, Snazzy Egg, RichardGaming, TacoDragon, vBxrby, Taeko, Dudi, ActuallySkeletor, Zed, Y0LK, Nyxian Guide, CGNik,\r\nRoger, MathAndCarnage, ButtuhDog, Saturn, Idksomedude, NollReed, Stelio, snekuru, anita maxx wynn, RogueViper, SunSmile, MrSwagon, maynerd, Skeeer, LordDjbj, GAZ Demon Warlord, SenorSanchezzz, IndieSnek, Pecyo\n\nAlagard Font by Hewett Tsoi\nNoto Sans by Google, licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.\n\nAnimation Mesh Baking Tool by LlamAcademy\nhttps://github.com/llamacademy/baked-animation-meshes\n\nSkill Icons Packs by Will Tice\nSkill icons Pack by Quintino Pixels\n\nFoliage Sprites by Kenney\n\nController Support - ReWired by Guavaman Enterprises\n\nSteamworks.net by Riley Labrecque\n\nAmog Model by moi0210 / MoiDev\nhttps://moi0210.itch.io/hazmat-suit-ps1-style\n\n\"Cartoon Bonk\" sound effect by Hanna-Barbera, used under CC BY 3.0 US. \r\n\nParticle Effect For UGUI (UI Particle) by Mob Sakai\nhttps://github.com/mob-sakai/ParticleEffectForUGUI\n\nDesert rocks - \"Desert | Rock | (FIXED) Pack\" (https://skfb.ly/orPIP) by YadroGames is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).\r\n\n\"Stylized Statue - Game Ready - With STL Files\" (https://skfb.ly/6Ywo8) by Matheus Elias is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).\n\n\"Ghost\" (https://skfb.ly/6WQrZ) by freshlybaked is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).\n\nModels from Kaylousberg (CC0 License)\nhttps://kaylousberg.itch.io/
